<!--
  Shared asset notes for the ZMK LVGL XML project.

  Background PNGs live in docs/ui/assets/ and are referenced from screens with:
    <lv_image src="../assets/<name>_bg.png" x="0" y="0" />

  generate embeds each PNG as an I1 LVGL image descriptor in status_screen_gen.c.
  Fonts use the module's selected Montserrat / unscii LVGL fonts at runtime.
  Set font_family="monospace" on compact labels to use Unscii 8, matching
  compact dynamic status text. Larger labels retain the Montserrat hierarchy.
